        "original_id": "d799efe3-bc51-5ae5-890a-7bdddff75699",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 1951 Asian Games, Asian Games sports\n- Organizations: Olympic Council of Asia (OCA)\n- Places: New Delhi, India\n- Topics: multi-sport events, event list changes\n\nFacts:\n- The 1951 Asian Games, officially called the First Asian Games, was a multi-sport event held in New Delhi, India from 4 to 11 March 1951.\n- On 29 June 2009, the Olympic Council of Asia announced major changes to the event lists in five major events.\n- The Olympic Council of Asia said the 2009 changes particularly aimed to restrict each sport to no more than one event, with possible exemptions.",
